(7668852, 1251383, 138630, '<td valign="top">Thanks, Roz. I thought it was pretty.  Funny thing is that it is in front of a neighborhood house that has been abandoned for over ten years.  Neighbors turn it in regularly because the yard is always so unkempt.  You couldn''t actually deliver mail to this box if you wanted to - it''s completely overgrown with this yucca (or something).  The post of the previous mailbox rotted out and it fell down.  For quite some time there was no box at all.  But I guess that''s against city code?? so the owners finally put up this new one.  Crazy.</td>', 'Thanks, Roz. I thought it was pretty.  Funny thing is that it is in front of a neighborhood house that has been abandoned for over ten years.  Neighbors turn it in regularly because the yard is always so unkempt.  You couldn''t actually deliver mail to this box if you wanted to - it''s completely overgrown with this yucca (or something).  The post of the previous mailbox rotted out and it fell down.  For quite some time there was no box at all.  But I guess that''s against city code?? so the owners finally put up this new one.  Crazy.', '2020-07-06 15:09:54.000000', NULL, 0),
